  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Truco de la familia",
    "@en": "Family Trick"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Los hermanos se distinguen por la edad, no por el sexo: **anh** (mayor, chico), **chị** (mayor, chica), **em** (menor, chico o chica). Para precisar: **em trai** (hermano menor), **em gái** (hermana menor).",
     "@en": "The brothers are distinguished by age, not sex: **anh** (major, boy), **chị** (major, girl), **em** (minor, boy or girl). To specify: **em trai** (younger brother), **em gái** (younger sister)."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Los abuelos dependen del lado: **nội** = por parte de padre, **ngoại** = por parte de madre. **bà ngoại** = la madre de tu madre.",
     "@en": "The grandparents depend on the side: **nội** = by father, **ngoại** = by mother. **bà ngoại** = your mother's mother."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Los tíos también: **chú** (hermano menor del padre), **cô** (hermana del padre), **cậu** (hermano de la madre), **dì** (hermana de la madre), **bác** (hermano/a mayor de los padres).",
     "@en": "The uncles also: **chú** (father's younger brother), **cô** (father's sister), **cậu** (mother's brother), **dì** (mother's sister), **bác** (parent's older brother)."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Estas palabras son también los pronombres que usas al hablar con la gente, según su edad.",
     "@en": "These words are also the pronouns you use when talking to people, according to their age."
    }
   ]
  },
